{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Descent.descended_level_zero","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Descent.descended_level_zero","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Descent.descended_level_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Descent.descended_level_zero","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Descent/descended_level_zero.lean#L29-L43","doc":"**Descended-level-zero collapse** (named conditional conjecture).\n\nFor a descended (holonomy) contribution function\n`desc_contrib : ℕ → ℝ` indexed by jet level, `descended_level_zero\ndesc_contrib` is the proposition that the descended contribution appears\nonly at jet level `0`:\n\n`∀ n, 1 ≤ n → desc_contrib n = 0`.\n\nThis names the conditional claim of the jet-tower descent proposition\n(pattern C); it is *not* asserted — an inhabitant witnesses the\nstabilisation of the descended projector under iterated descent. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:descended-level-zero","label":"prop:descended-level-zero","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/descended-level-zero.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}